<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's chip shares fall on price fears.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's chip shares fall on price fears.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of South Korea's chip makers including Samsung Electronics dropped in Wednesday afternoon trading on fears that international spot prices for semiconductors would fall further, brokers said.</p>
</text>
